    # "Nijah, still pale white from seeing us feasting on Tarek, led us back up the stairs in a hurry."
    "ニジャは、まだタレクを喰らう我々の姿に青ざめたまま、急いで階段を上って我々を導いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_3.rpy:139
